// mi50_gen.cpp - host build tool: generates the TinyGPU dext's MI50 tables from their primary sources.
//   MI50Regs.h     every register the MI50 bring-up touches: dword address = vega20_ip_offset.h base[seg] + the Linux offset
//                  (amdgpu SOC15_REG_OFFSET), field shift/mask from the Linux sh_mask header. Each address and field is also checked
//                  against tinygrad's autogen table (the reference driver's own numbers); any difference stops the build.
//   MI50Firmware.h the twelve linux-firmware Vega 20 images (SHA-256 checked against tinygrad's pinned hashes, autogen/am/fw.py),
//                  cut into the payloads the PSP is handed, in the reference driver's load order (amdev.py AMFirmware._init_vega20).
// Usage: mi50_gen <linux drivers/gpu/drm/amd> <tinygrad autogen/am/regs.py> <firmware dir> <out dir>
#include <CommonCrypto/CommonDigest.h>
#include <cstdint>
